    "description": "Listen live to Atlanta's news, weather and traffic station 24 hours a day. Also, get Eric Von Haessler on demand.\r\n\r\nReceive notifications for Traffic Red Alerts, Severe Weather Warnings and Breaking News.  Also, use our Open Mic to deliver traffic and breaking news tips, and to leave your comments for our hosts.\r\n\r\nNews 95-5 and AM750 WSB is Atlanta's News, Weather and Traffic - Specializing in Triple Team Airborne Traffic, Accurate Weather Forecasts, Severe Weather Coverage, and Atlanta & Georgia's Breaking News.  Informative talk with Rush Limbaugh, Eric Von Haessler, Sean Hannity, Erick Erickson, and Clark Howard.",
